  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "At Mirror Lake, Ma Shang Feng hesitates between Fei Sheng, taken in after Ma tribe annexed Fei tribe, and Cheng Hu. Cheng tribe was subjugated during heroes assembly and is then the second most influential force in Ma tribe’s army. Cheng Hu bows, rushes to the frontline, and challenges loudly. He pounces on Song tribe’s Su Yi. After an even stretch he roars, his whole body giving off dazzling orange light.",
      "chapters": [
        523
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_mirror_lake",
        "char_ma_shang_feng",
        "char_fei_sheng",
        "fac_ma_tribe",
        "fac_fei_tribe",
        "fac_cheng_tribe",
        "fac_song_tribe",
        "char_su_yi"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He can change parts of his body into a tiger tail, tiger claws, tiger skin, and so on. The complete transformation is a killer move. After the orange light disperses he completes that transformation, bites apart Su Yi’s head, and wins Ma tribe the first victory of that battle.",
      "chapters": [
        523
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "After orange light disperses, he has unexpectedly transformed into a striped tiger king the size of an elephant. The tiger king’s tail lashes like a steel whip and breaks Su Yi’s light barrier.",
      "chapters": [
        523
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "When Hao Ji Liu taunts Ma tribe’s line, a boorish guy stands up. He is Ma tribe’s general, a rank four transformation path Gu Master.",
      "chapters": [
        537
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "human-look",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_hao_ji_liu",
        "sys_gu_master"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He fights Hao Ji Liu, falls into disadvantage, and activates his killer move, transforming into slant-eye tiger. The tiger turns the fight until Hao Ji Liu can only retreat and defend.",
      "chapters": [
        537
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "slant-eye-tiger",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "The battle then deadlocks. After the killer move spends primeval essence he would return to human form, and Hao Ji Liu would retaliate. He finally loses and escapes. Hao Ji Liu has no strength to chase.",
      "chapters": [
        538
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "deadlock-and-escape",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cheng Long is named a rank five transformation path expert and Cheng Hu’s big brother.",
      "chapters": [
        539
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "elder-brother",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_cheng_long"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In a chaotic melee someone strikes him from behind and sends him flying toward Fang Yuan. He pounces and his limbs transform into a gorgeous tiger as he lands, the same transformation path killer move, slant-eye tiger. A pair of large hands grab the tiger’s neck and immobilize it. He slashes with two sharp claws. Those two tiger claws are then grabbed separately by two metallic hands. He sees two bronze arms grown from Fang Yuan’s sides, and the bronze hands firmly grab the tiger claws. Fang Yuan’s killer move is then named Four Arm Earth King. He is usually carefree and takes his bravery as an honor, but he feels fear. The bronze hands pull and rip the tiger into two halves. The parts transform back into two halves of a human. The tiger head turns back to Cheng Hu’s head, eyes wide in fear. Fang Yuan grabs the skull.",
      "chapters": [
        541
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "field-death",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "move_four_arm_earth_king"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Later narration uses the Imperial Court contest as an example: ordinary transformation path Gu Masters could only specialize in one kind of transformation, and Cheng Hu could only transform into a tiger.",
      "chapters": [
        1041
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "one-transformation",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "evt_arc_imperial_court_contest",
        "fac_gu_masters"
      ]
    }
  ],
